Toko-chan ran away from her home
and came to my place for a visit...

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.230
Would it be better if I told
Sachiko-sama about it?

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.400
Yumi, Mass is about to start.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:52.500
What?

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.100
Oh, right.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.880
The Blank Map to the Future

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:04.480
See you!

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.120
Have a Happy New Year!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.380
Like this?

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.590
Right. It comes out neatly, doesn't it?

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.360
Yes.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.690
Good day.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:18.490
What's this, Shimako-san?

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.170
Trying your hand at making a cake?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.330
It's nothing big.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.200
I just felt like giving it a try.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:25.910
What?
What?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.930
And then Rei-sama offered to teach me.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.510
Now, all that's left is decoration.

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:32.680
I see.
