so Shimako-san thought to inherit her flavors.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:44.250
I guess in the coming days, we'll be
"feeling" the graduation like this...

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.320
Pardon me for being late.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.860
Oh, Yumi-sama.

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.860
I'm sorry about this morning.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.470
Oh, no, I'm sorry, too.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:02:59.900
Are you alone?

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.610
Kanako-san and Toko will be coming shortly.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:06.410
We ran into the Rosa Chinensis on the
way here, so I left them with her.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:09.120
Since I was asked to bring this.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.620
For the
Christmas Party

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:11.750
Oh!

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.120
It's Yoko-sama's handwriting!

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.050
That's the former Rosa Chinensis, correct?

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.350
That's right.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.590
Kanako-chan and the others are coming shortly?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.290
Then I better go, too.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.430
That Yoshino...

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.510
Today's party is also the occasion...

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:38.170
...when Yoshino-san will introduce her
prospective little sister to Rei-sama.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.480
Then, would you mind putting these up with me?

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.140
Not at all.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:52.590
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:53.890
Onee-sama!

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.890
Kanako-chan! Toko-chan!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.460
Yumi-sama, thank you very
much for inviting us today.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.640
Good day, ladies.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.840
Thank you for inviting me again this year.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.640
Pardon me for being late.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.480
Am I the last to arrive?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.920
I'm not, am I?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.860
Since I don't see Yoshino-san here.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:23.460
Yoshino...

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.080
This way.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.890
Sorry for keeping you waiting!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.290
Um...

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.420
This is bad!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.570
Rei-sama is nervous about meeting
the prospective little sister,

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.340
but that nervousness has
caught Yoshino-san by surprise...

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.280
...and has made her mind go blank!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.840
So, that girl is Nana-san...

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.680
Hang in there, Yoshino-san!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.280
Then, shall we get the group
photo out of the way first?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:54.320
What?
What?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.290
Could I ask you to line up
in two rows over there?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.920
That's Tsutako-san for you!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.790
She changed the mood for everyone.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.300
Toko-chan, get in closer towards the middle.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:10.470
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.370
I appreciate what you did.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.030
What?

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.240
For coming when you had plans.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.910
Oh, but I wondered if it wasn't
quite like me to do that.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:23.010
Yeah, it was out of character for you.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.220
I'm taking it now.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.620
Okay, thank you very much.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.960
Then, shall we begin?

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.130
Let us determine seating by drawing lots.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.260
What? Drawing lots?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.700
Yoshino-san's so disappointed.

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:49.400
Because she didn't get a seat
next to Arima Nana-san.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:54.740
I'm separated from Toko-chan too,
so I'd love to trade places with her, but...

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.550
Shall we start off with simple introductions...

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.420
...and updates on recent goings-on?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:00.760
It has been a long time since we have
been together like this, after all.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.520
Why introductions now?
It has been a long time since we have
been together like this, after all.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.580
It has been a long time since we have
been together like this, after all.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.780
Right, Rei?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:05.260
Since the school festival, I think.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.530
Oh, right! It's for Arima Nana-san.
Since the school festival, I think.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:07.990
Oh, right! It's for Arima Nana-san.
Yeah, it's a good idea.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.730
I am Takeshima Tsutako, Year 2, Pine Class.

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.170
I belong to the Photography Club.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.770
Once introductions are over, I intend
to focus on being the photographer.

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:21.370
I hope that you will not be offended.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.480
I am Nijyo Noriko, the Rosa Gigantea en bouton.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.790
My hobby is viewing Buddhist statues.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.350
When the finals were over,

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.690
I had planned on going on a little
excursion to see Buddhist statues,

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.630
but I missed my chance to go.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.090
I am Hasekura Rei, the Rosa Foetida.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.700
I am on the kendo team.

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:52.470
But in actuality, it looks like this will
be my last month as an active member.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.530
Hmm, was there anything else?

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:57.910
Oh, that's right.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.250
Due to a strange turn of events,

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.310
I have recently found
myself a younger boyfriend.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.040
What?

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.550
How old was he again?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.160
10 years old, I think.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.220
10 years old?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.560
Yumi-chan.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:18.890
Tag!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.900
Fukuzawa Yumi, Year 2, Pine Class.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.380
I am the Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.840
Um...

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:34.580
I went to the amusement park with
my dear sister during the break...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.020
...and on the way home,
we dropped by her residence...

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.010
...and I received her mother's
homemade millefeuille.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.650
It was so delicious.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.570
My name is Arima Nana and I am
a third-year in middle school.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.260
Thank you very much for inviting me.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:59.810
I became acquainted with
Shimazu Yoshino-sama by pure chance...

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.210
...and when I heard of this party,

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.270
I asked her to bring me, because
I wanted to attend very much.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:10.080
Being so young, I imagine
I will show my inexperience,

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.780
but I ask that you please
provide me with guidance.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:21.350
After that, my dear sister talked
about going to the amusement park,

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:25.090
Kanako-chan reported that she
had joined the basketball team,

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:30.430
and Shimako-san spoke of her
new-found interest in making sweets.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.530
And finally...

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.880
I am Matsudaira Toko, Year 1, Camellia Class.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.280
I belong to the Drama Club.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.040
Is that all?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.890
"Young Sir, I have no need of that."

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:06.410
"Oh, my, so you meant it as
charity for a street beggar..."

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.470
"...in honor of Christmas Eve tradition."

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.370
"Thank you very much."

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:15.240
"What a kind person you are, Young Sir."

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:23.120
I got it! It's "A Little Princess"!

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:25.130
"It can't be helped."

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:28.800
"My clothes are in tatters
and I'm always hungry..."

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.700
"It's not surprising that I was
mistaken for a street beggar."

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.770
Will that do, Kanako-san?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:53.380
I have nothing special to report,
so that was in lieu of my speech...

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.790
She captivated her audience in
such a short amount of time...

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.600
Toko-chan really is incredible.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.070
This tastes the same as Rei-chan's.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:22.950
The Yule log cake that Rei-sama and
Shimako-san made was very delicious.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.320
After that, there were no scheduled activities,

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:31.760
so we enjoyed our time
playing games and chatting.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.230
If it's about Kanako-chan, she left already.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.940
She said she had promised
to go meet her mother.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:53.380
She said she was leaving quietly
so as not to ruin the jovial mood.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.310
What?

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:57.080
She must have not wanted Toko-chan to notice.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.110
That is hard to say.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.980
I see. Thank you very much.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.190
Time for the next game!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.550
Okay!
Okay!

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.230
Noriko-chan, you are doing well!

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.830
Noriko-chan, hurry!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.460
Fifth card from the top, please.

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:20.800
Wait, Shimako-san.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:26.840
About Toko-chan?

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:31.080
Toko-chan asked me if I was going
to take over the family business.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.180
The family business?

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:34.320
In my case, that would be the temple.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.850
And what did you say?

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.060
I answered that I did not know.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.960
And then she asked what
would happen to the temple...

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.790
...if I did not take it over.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.100
What will happen?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.830
I do not know. I hope my elder
brother will take it over, though.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:50.370
You have an older brother?!

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:55.700
Yes. When I told Toko-chan that,
she looked a bit disappointed.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.700
I wonder if something happened with her family.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.240
That seems likely.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.510
I guess she couldn't come to me.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.580
But I should think you could be
there for her to talk to, Yumi-san.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.580
You mustn't be impatient.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:12.990
Yeah...

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.500
Why am I the only one who didn't know...

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.330
...about this major
development in your life, Rei-chan?!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.800
What happened?

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:32.670
Yoshino-san brought Nana-san
over to the Rosa Foetida and...

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.380
Rei-chan! Rei-chan!

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:39.380
Nana says she wants to fight
a match with you someday.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.420
Sure. Come on over to my
place during winter break.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.020
There's no rush.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.030
We could do it in the spring, when you
come to coach your underclassmen.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.030
I won't be coming to coach.

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:54.520
What? But Lillian Women's College
is located on the same grounds...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.370
I didn't submit an application
for priority enrollment.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:12:59.830
What do you mean?

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:05.140
It means that I'm not going to the college here.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.550
Sachiko-sama, Rei-chan's...

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.680
Calm down, Yoshino-chan.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:16.980
Sachiko-sama... you knew?

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.030
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.450
You never asked.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.190
Why would I ask?!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:29.000
You told me all along that you were
going to Lillian Women's College!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.030
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.410
Why are you going to a different university?

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.740
Because I want to major in a subject
that's not offered at Lillian.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.900
What's that?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.920
I'm planning on studying physical education.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.260
Because I think I'll continue to be
involved with my family's training hall,

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.750
even though I don't know if I'll take it over.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.760
And in terms of knowledge,

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.590
knowing about exercise and
how the body works will be useful.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.290
And above all, it's what I want to study.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:07.400
I wish you could've told me this in private.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:11.770
If you'd talked to me properly,
I wouldn't have been against it.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.510
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.950
I wanted to be the first to know...

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:17.780
I'm sorry.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.520
What about you, Onee-sama?

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.190
What do you plan to do
after graduating, Onee-sama?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.130
I would have preferred to have
this discussion in private,

00:14:34.130 --> 00:14:36.190
in a quieter setting.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.640
Pardon me.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.940
I will be going to the college at Lillian.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.680
I see...

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:47.940
What?!

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:52.490
Would it be a problem if I were to
remain on the same school grounds?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.660
T-That is not it.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.680
Congratulations!

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.220
How silly of you.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.190
I submitted my application,
but the acceptance is still to come.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.690
I'm so glad! I won't have to be
separated from my dear sister.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.370
Oh, right! I should give my dear sister
her present before I forget.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.420
Wait!

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:29.620
Are you leaving?

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:33.560
Yes, since we were given
permission to leave early.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.820
And Kanako-san already left
sometime along the way...

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.860
Why are you following me?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.060
I just thought I'd like to walk with you a bit.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:49.100
With no consideration for how I might feel?

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.380
Would it bother you?

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:53.710
No.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:04.460
So you really are just walking with me.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.360
What?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.390
I thought there might be something
you wanted to talk about.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.800
Oh, talking. Right.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.320
Yeah, shall we talk?

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.500
Rei-sama was a surprise, wasn't it?

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.640
Going to a different university...

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.680
Sachiko-sama will be remaining at Lillian,

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:23.400
so you must be delighted, Yumi-sama.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.580
Well, in other words,

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:29.920
the third-year students are
steadily beginning to take steps...

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.580
...towards their respective visions
of the future, if you will...

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:36.720
Not everyone gets to do
exactly what they envision.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:39.290
What?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.690
Toko-chan?

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:50.840
In grade school, we were given blank,
new maps during social studies...

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.930
...and in that moment, I felt incredibly happy.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:17:00.210
I was going to create mountains
and cities on this map.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:02.180
I was going to create a perfect map,

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.450
better than anyone's, like those printed in books.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.890
But as class progressed, I realized...

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.760
...that things do not go so smoothly.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:21.560
The finished page was completely
different from what I had envisioned.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:27.240
This was true, even with a single blank map.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.340
There was no way life was
going to go smoothly either.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.900
That was the realization I had come to.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:35.020
If a perfect map was going to be impossible,

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:38.890
I should have just colored it with
pink flower patterns and polka dots.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:43.520
Then, I may have been able to create
a pretty map that was all my own.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.550
But...

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.790
...I was not able to do that.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:48.890
Toko-chan...

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:53.070
Pardon my nonsensical rambling.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.330
Please forget about it.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.770
Toko-chan!

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.190
Won't you...

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.400
...be my little sister?

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:30.370
Pardon?

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:33.260
Can't I... be the one?

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:35.570
Yumi-sama...

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.990
"Thank you very much."

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.900
"What a kind person you are, Yumi-sama."

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.060
What?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.070
Did you think I would say such a thing?

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:09.210
I am not a good girl like the
protagonist of "A Little Princess."

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:12.580
If it's Christmas Eve charity,
please bestow it elsewhere.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:13.480
Toko-chan...

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:13.610
At any rate, I cannot accept that rosary.
Toko-chan...

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:16.170
At any rate, I cannot accept that rosary.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.610
Please excuse me.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:42.740
Yumi.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.040
Onee-sama.

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:47.740
I thought that if I waited here,
I could get a moment alone with you.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.190
It's a handkerchief, isn't it?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.860
Open it and see.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:00.790
Please don't think it uncreative
and the same as last year.

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:04.190
You see, I tried adding
a personal touch this year.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:08.540
Roses...

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.190
Red Roses...

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:12.730
Thank you very much.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.310
Oh, that's right! Me, too.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.170
Oh, my!

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:30.060
Oh, my, a book jacket!

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.150
This is a rose, isn't it?

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.430
How like-minded we are.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:39.050
Thank you.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.530
I will use it winter and summer.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:44.430
It will get hot in the summer...

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:47.830
What is the matter?

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.100
Onee-sama, I...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.080
Did something happen with Toko-chan?

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:03.180
She didn't accept... my rosary...

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:08.120
I see.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.530
Toko-chan is not the only
first-year student out there.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.460
But...

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.070
Of course.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:19.930
Then, you can just keep at it!

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:20.800
What?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:24.650
When Shimako refused me,

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.480
I thought that it did not have to be her.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.950
But it was different when you refused me.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.580
I wanted to make you accept the
rosary if it was the last thing I did.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:39.760
Being turned down once is nothing.

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.930
Hold your head high.

00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:43.760
I will.

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:47.760
But...

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.890
...it does hurt, doesn't it?

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:52.070
Yes.

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:00.010
Um...

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.110
Would it be all right if I still cried a bit?

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.020
Yes.

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:47.730
A winterscape where even...
Machi no irodori sae doko

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:52.500
...the town's colors seem forlorn somehow
to naku samishige na fuyu no keshiki

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:56.500
I think of you, turning your back on me...
Senaka mise kaketeitta

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:00.230
...and running off
anata o omou

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:05.210
There's a clear square pane...
Futari no aida ni wa

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:09.220
...between the two of us
toumei na shikakkei

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:11.990
It's misted over right now...
Ima wa kasunderu

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:18.580
...with the crystals of sighs
tame-iki no kesshou de

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:23.230
Window glass, window glass
Mado garasu mado garasu

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:29.200
It's clouded and I can't see you
Kumottete anata ga mienai no

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:35.000
Even though I know that you're there
Soko ni iru koto wa wakatteiru no ni

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:39.150
Are you smiling? Are you crying?
Waratteru naiteru no

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:45.150
I don't even care if you're frowning, let me see you
Shikamettsura demo ii kara misete

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:53.620
Wipe the glass from your side, too
Sochira no hou kara mo garasu o fuite

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:06.970
Preview

00:24:06.970 --> 00:24:09.610
Preview
On New Year's, I brought up
the matter with my parents...

00:24:09.610 --> 00:24:12.380
Preview
