engagement to Suguru-san.

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:14.850
Preview
I think that would be fine.
The two of you are still young.

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:17.020
Preview
But was it not the plan to have us marry...

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.990
Preview
...and put the Ogasawara Group in our care?

00:24:18.990 --> 00:24:21.720
Preview
Oh, the reason for the engagement
was because in kindergarten,

00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:24.220
Preview
you said you wanted to be Suguru-san's bride.

00:24:24.220 --> 00:24:26.560
Preview
I had hardened my resolve,
as if making a leap in the dark,

00:24:26.560 --> 00:24:27.130
Preview
I had hardened my resolve,
as if making a leap in the dark,
On the Other Side of the Clouded Glass

00:24:27.130 --> 00:24:28.560
Preview
but my wish was blithely accepted.
On the Other Side of the Clouded Glass

